    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a team of heroes in this <strong>physics</strong>-based medieval football/soccer game. Train and <strong>upgrade</strong> your team as you progress through a world torn by conflict, uncovering each character\u2019s tales while exposing the dark schemes of corrupt nobles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey in makeshift tournaments and fight your way to the grandest arenas in the land, where bloodthirsty crowds will judge your performance without mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware! Your opponents will stop at nothing to win. Expect neither fair play from them nor justice from the <i>Brabeutos</i> who determine the fate of each match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast paced action</strong> - Easy to grasp yet hard to master real-time physics mechanics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RPG Style Progression</strong> - Unlock and upgrade new characters in an RPG-like progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox mode</strong> - Play at your own pace, unblocking tournaments as you improve your skills and those of your team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge</strong> - Win against all odds when facing popular opponents that will use any resource at their disposal to beat you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic audience</strong> -\u00a0Spectators responds to the match development and even actively participates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: Brabatos is currently in development. Features, content, and mechanics are subject to change as we continue to build, test, and improve the experience based on player feedback.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a team of heroes in this <strong>physics</strong>-based medieval football/soccer game. Train and <strong>upgrade</strong> your team as you progress through a world torn by conflict, uncovering each character\u2019s tales while exposing the dark schemes of corrupt nobles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey in makeshift tournaments and fight your way to the grandest arenas in the land, where bloodthirsty crowds will judge your performance without mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware! Your opponents will stop at nothing to win. Expect neither fair play from them nor justice from the <i>Brabeutos</i> who determine the fate of each match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast paced action</strong> - Easy to grasp yet hard to master real-time physics mechanics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RPG Style Progression</strong> - Unlock and upgrade new characters in an RPG-like progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox mode</strong> - Play at your own pace, unblocking tournaments as you improve your skills and those of your team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge</strong> - Win against all odds when facing popular opponents that will use any resource at their disposal to beat you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic audience</strong> -\u00a0Spectators responds to the match development and even actively participates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: Brabatos is currently in development. Features, content, and mechanics are subject to change as we continue to build, test, and improve the experience based on player feedback.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Brabatos is a single-player medieval football action game where you lead a team of misfit heroes through ruthless tournaments across the land. The mechanics are easy to pick up but hard to master, demanding sharp reflexes and split-second decisions.",
